WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.043 --> 00:00:07.298
Well, I'm sure nothing would happen
between a wolf and a rabbit.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.301
Especially Legoshi.

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:14.639
Are you nervous? Just relax.

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:19.477
It's my first time, too, with a carnivore.

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.688
Is this a kind of greeting?

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:26.067
Your belly hair's the same color
as your face.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:29.654
This is how small animals greet
each other?

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:31.990
Such a beautiful cream color.

00:00:33.491 --> 00:00:35.326
I want to know...

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:37.162
where it leads to.

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:41.041
What?

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:44.419
I need you to be cooperative
to create a romantic atmosphere.

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:46.588
Isn't that what you came here for?

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:49.340
-What do you mean?
-I'm saying...

00:00:53.094 --> 00:00:54.512
Oh, gosh.

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:57.348
Did I jump to conclusions?

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.100
But still, he refuses after

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:00.935
-I took off his belt?
-You'll catch a cold.

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:04.689
You may also get bug bites.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.733
You should get dressed.

00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:08.026
I'm going back.

00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:09.402
Sorry to bother you!

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.201
He's gone.

00:01:19.537 --> 00:01:21.915
So he really didn't come here for that.

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.542
I feel guilty.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:27.045
Of course he'd run away.

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:31.299
Wait, really?

00:01:31.382 --> 00:01:34.385
How come a big carnivore like him
would want to run away?

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:38.556
He was seduced
and all he did was to cover me up?

00:01:42.393 --> 00:01:43.561
That's ridiculous.

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.065
What a weirdo.

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:01.955
What was that?

00:02:02.497 --> 00:02:05.125
What just happened to me?

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.417
Legoshi.

00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:11.005
I'm sorry about that.

00:02:11.089 --> 00:02:12.924
I was waiting for you to return.

00:02:13.007 --> 00:02:14.926
Hey, why did you leave--

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:17.428
Anyway, nothing happened to you?

00:02:19.264 --> 00:02:21.307
Nothing in particular.

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:25.436
-What should we do?
-Let me see.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:27.981
I see. I'm relieved.

00:02:28.106 --> 00:02:30.608
You were running down the stairs
four at a time,

00:02:30.692 --> 00:02:32.777
so I thought you were in a fix.

00:02:32.861 --> 00:02:35.613
What do you mean by... a fix?

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:40.618
There's a buzz among the herbivores

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:42.495
about that rabbit.

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:47.542
Apparently, she's sleeping around
with so many males.

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:50.170
I mean, that's a slut.

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:54.215
Can you believe it? She looks so innocent.

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:58.303
I guess even she couldn't do anything
to a wolf, though.

00:02:58.344 --> 00:03:00.305
So, did you get roses?

00:03:04.142 --> 00:03:05.643
Flowers...

00:03:06.644 --> 00:03:10.064
She said she tends flowers thoroughly

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:13.151
as if they're her children.

00:03:14.235 --> 00:03:18.406
I'll talk to everyone and scratch the plan
of getting roses from the garden.

00:03:20.158 --> 00:03:22.535
You might be hearing
a lot of things about her,

00:03:23.244 --> 00:03:24.704
but I think she's nice.

00:03:27.832 --> 00:03:29.042
What a weirdo.

